    <id>tag:github.com,2008:Repository/385183546/v0.40.0</id>
    <updated>2026-09-11T08:33:25Z</updated>
    <link rel="alternate" type="text/html" href="https://github.com/grafana/rollout-operator/releases/tag/v0.40.0"/>
    <title>v0.40.0</title>
    <content type="html">&lt;p&gt;Docker images: &lt;code&gt;grafana/rollout-operator:v0.40.0&lt;/code&gt; and &lt;code&gt;grafana/rollout-operator-boringcrypto:v0.40.0&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Changelog&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;[CHANGE] ZPDB cross-zone eviction delays use the Pod Ready condition&#39;s &lt;code&gt;lastTransitionTime&lt;/code&gt; instead of the &lt;code&gt;grafana.com/ready-time&lt;/code&gt; annotation, eliminating annotation PATCH requests and measuring the delay from Kubernetes readiness transitions. The &lt;code&gt;-zpdb.pod-ready-annotation-patch-timeout&lt;/code&gt; flag is deprecated, has no effect, and logs a warning when supplied. &lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5293544115&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/grafana/rollout-operator/issues/498&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/grafana/rollout-operator/pull/498/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/grafana/rollout-operator/pull/498&quot;&gt;#498&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;[ENHANCEMENT] Update Go to &lt;code&gt;1.27&lt;/code&gt; &lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5235388698&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/grafana/rollout-operator/issues/494&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/grafana/rollout-operator/pull/494/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/grafana/rollout-operator/pull/494&quot;&gt;#494&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;[ENHANCEMENT] Updated dependencies, including: &lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5230352990&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/grafana/rollout-operator/issues/491&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/grafana/rollout-operator/pull/491/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/grafana/rollout-operator/pull/491&quot;&gt;#491&lt;/a&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;code&gt;github.com/stretchr/testify&lt;/code&gt; from &lt;code&gt;v1.12.0&lt;/code&gt; to &lt;code&gt;v1.12.1&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;code&gt;k8s.io/api&lt;/code&gt; from &lt;code&gt;v0.36.3&lt;/code&gt; to &lt;code&gt;v0.36.4&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;code&gt;k8s.io/apiextensions-apiserver&lt;/code&gt; from &lt;code&gt;v0.36.3&lt;/code&gt; to &lt;code&gt;v0.36.4&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;code&gt;k8s.io/apimachinery&lt;/code&gt; from &lt;code&gt;v0.36.3&lt;/code&gt; to &lt;code&gt;v0.36.4&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;code&gt;k8s.io/client-go&lt;/code&gt; from &lt;code&gt;v0.36.3&lt;/code&gt; to &lt;code&gt;v0.36.4&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;[ENHANCEMENT] Updated dependencies to address CVEs, including: &lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5318854382&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/grafana/rollout-operator/issues/501&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/grafana/rollout-operator/pull/501/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/grafana/rollout-operator/pull/501&quot;&gt;#501&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5394012110&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/grafana/rollout-operator/issues/502&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/grafana/rollout-operator/pull/502/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/grafana/rollout-operator/pull/502&quot;&gt;#502&lt;/a&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;code&gt;google.golang.org/grpc&lt;/code&gt; from &lt;code&gt;v1.83.0&lt;/code&gt; to &lt;code&gt;v1.83.2&lt;/code&gt; for &lt;a title=&quot;CVE-2026-84304&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;advisory&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/advisories/GHSA-vp52-pcj8-j9qc/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/advisories/GHSA-vp52-pcj8-j9qc&quot;&gt;CVE-2026-84304&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a title=&quot;CVE-2026-84303&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;advisory&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/advisories/GHSA-qc2q-p7wx-3px3/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/advisories/GHSA-qc2q-p7wx-3px3&quot;&gt;CVE-2026-84303&lt;/a&gt; and &lt;a title=&quot;CVE-2026-84445&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;advisory&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/advisories/GHSA-2v4p-qf9q-27wj/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/advisories/GHSA-2v4p-qf9q-27wj&quot;&gt;CVE-2026-84445&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;</content>
