  <entry>
    <id>tag:github.com,2008:Repository/385183546/v0.38.0</id>
    <updated>2026-06-09T10:30:00Z</updated>
    <link rel="alternate" type="text/html" href="https://github.com/grafana/rollout-operator/releases/tag/v0.38.0"/>
    <title>v0.38.0</title>
    <content type="html">&lt;p&gt;Docker images: &lt;code&gt;grafana/rollout-operator:v0.38.0&lt;/code&gt; and &lt;code&gt;grafana/rollout-operator-boringcrypto:v0.38.0&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Changelog&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;[CHANGE] Client-side rate limiting to the Kubernetes API is now enforced with an independent token bucket per API group (e.g. &lt;code&gt;core/v1&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;apps/v1&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;policy/v1&lt;/code&gt;), and each admission webhook gets its own dedicated client so an overloaded webhook cannot throttle the others or the core controller. As a result, the meaning of &lt;code&gt;-kubernetes.client-qps=0&lt;/code&gt; changed: it previously fell back to the client-go default (~5 QPS / 10 burst per API group), but now disables client-side rate limiting entirely. The defaults of &lt;code&gt;-kubernetes.client-qps&lt;/code&gt; (now &lt;code&gt;5&lt;/code&gt;) and &lt;code&gt;-kubernetes.client-burst&lt;/code&gt; (now &lt;code&gt;10&lt;/code&gt;) preserve the previous effective throttling. &lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;4588597063&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/grafana/rollout-operator/issues/441&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/grafana/rollout-operator/pull/441/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/grafana/rollout-operator/pull/441&quot;&gt;#441&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;[FEATURE] Added &lt;code&gt;-server-tls.request-timeout&lt;/code&gt; to configure the request timeout of the TLS server that serves the admission webhooks (used as the read and write timeouts). Defaults to &lt;code&gt;10s&lt;/code&gt;, matching the previous hardcoded value. &lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;4588597063&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/grafana/rollout-operator/issues/441&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/grafana/rollout-operator/pull/441/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/grafana/rollout-operator/pull/441&quot;&gt;#441&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;[FEATURE] Added &lt;code&gt;-pods.client-timeout&lt;/code&gt; to configure the timeout of HTTP requests issued directly to pod endpoints (e.g. prepare-downscale). Defaults to &lt;code&gt;5s&lt;/code&gt;, matching the previous hardcoded value. &lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;4588597063&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/grafana/rollout-operator/issues/441&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/grafana/rollout-operator/pull/441/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/grafana/rollout-operator/pull/441&quot;&gt;#441&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;[BUGFIX] Admission webhook handlers now run under a context deadline (90% of &lt;code&gt;-server-tls.request-timeout&lt;/code&gt;). Without it, a burst of concurrent webhook requests (e.g. pod evictions during node draining) on the deadline-less webhook request contexts drove the client-side rate limiter&#39;s token-bucket reservation timeline to run away and stall, so the rollout-operator&#39;s Kubernetes API requests collapsed to near-zero throughput and webhooks failed with &lt;code&gt;context canceled&lt;/code&gt;. The deadline also cancels in-flight Kubernetes API calls when it elapses. &lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;4588597063&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/grafana/rollout-operator/issues/441&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/grafana/rollout-operator/pull/441/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/grafana/rollout-operator/pull/441&quot;&gt;#441&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;[ENHANCEMENT] Updated dependencies, including: &lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;4559811202&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/grafana/rollout-operator/issues/439&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/grafana/rollout-operator/pull/439/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/grafana/rollout-operator/pull/439&quot;&gt;#439&lt;/a&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;code&gt;github.com/grafana/dskit&lt;/code&gt; from &lt;code&gt;v0.0.0-20260505171221-7f6e6a43e255&lt;/code&gt; to &lt;code&gt;v0.0.0-20260601123808-0d4540e255b4&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;code&gt;github.com/prometheus/common&lt;/code&gt; from &lt;code&gt;v0.67.5&lt;/code&gt; to &lt;code&gt;v0.68.0&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;code&gt;go.opentelemetry.io/contrib/instrumentation/net/http/httptrace/otelhttptrace&lt;/code&gt; from &lt;code&gt;v0.68.0&lt;/code&gt; to &lt;code&gt;v0.69.0&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;code&gt;go.opentelemetry.io/contrib/instrumentation/net/http/otelhttp&lt;/code&gt; from &lt;code&gt;v0.68.0&lt;/code&gt; to &lt;code&gt;v0.69.0&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;code&gt;go.opentelemetry.io/otel/trace&lt;/code&gt; from &lt;code&gt;v1.43.0&lt;/code&gt; to &lt;code&gt;v1.44.0&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;code&gt;go.opentelemetry.io/otel&lt;/code&gt; from &lt;code&gt;v1.43.0&lt;/code&gt; to &lt;code&gt;v1.44.0&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;code&gt;golang.org/x/mod&lt;/code&gt; from &lt;code&gt;v0.35.0&lt;/code&gt; to &lt;code&gt;v0.36.0&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;code&gt;k8s.io/api&lt;/code&gt; from &lt;code&gt;v0.36.0&lt;/code&gt; to &lt;code&gt;v0.36.1&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;code&gt;k8s.io/apiextensions-apiserver&lt;/code&gt; from &lt;code&gt;v0.36.0&lt;/code&gt; to &lt;code&gt;v0.36.1&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;code&gt;k8s.io/apimachinery&lt;/code&gt; from &lt;code&gt;v0.36.0&lt;/code&gt; to &lt;code&gt;v0.36.1&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;code&gt;k8s.io/client-go&lt;/code&gt; from &lt;code&gt;v0.36.0&lt;/code&gt; to &lt;code&gt;v0.36.1&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;code&gt;sigs.k8s.io/controller-runtime&lt;/code&gt; from &lt;code&gt;v0.24.0&lt;/code&gt; to &lt;code&gt;v0.24.1&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;</content>
